From e74f9d80bc78df8273ee5acfa479614f7696ddc2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: soyjxck <soyjxck@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:40:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(gcm): execute prepared flips at their FIFO position

Adapt prepared-flip portions of MIT fork commits 6eb35c0 and 6cba82c. Keep existing present gating and ordinary flip accounting. Use atomic per-buffer acknowledgements and a non-overwriting position fallback; cancel skipped preparations on resync. Preserve immediate-only titles, reject malformed contexts, and remove the obsolete flip-now diagnostic mode.

Co-authored-by: pi <pi@localhost>
